Z||000005||BENGAL4||12-01-1999||08:13 PM||||Thanks for the replies. They have been doing testing in a few selected counties for a few years. 3 years ago, the state stopped the "E-check" program and it was reorganized. The y started it up again and there are groups trying to get it stopped once and for all. I had to get my 86GT checked this year and while they were running the test, I noticed smoke coming from my rear wheels. The attendant had left the e-brake on. Said he thought it was off but I know he heard the warning chime. I don't think this guy could spell cat even if you spotted him the c and the a. ||||reg||14
